#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_network_stats.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The header shows an overall health rating (Excellent / Good / Fair / Poor) and a MOS score. MOS (Mean Opinion Score) is a 1–5 estimate of call quality derived from latency, jitter and packet loss: 5 is excellent, and anything below 3.5 usually feels uncomfortable."
msgstr "The header shows an overall health rating (Excellent / Good / Fair / Poor) and a MOS score. MOS (Mean Opinion Score) is a 1–5 estimate of call quality derived from latency, jitter and packet loss: 5 is excellent, and anything below 3.5 usually feels uncomfortable."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_network_stats.html.heex:45
